      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Vamos a ver las respuestas correctas a los ejercicios del artículo de ayer. <br><strong>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</strong></p><p></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3f56fd?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiaXJkc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzE5NTc2MTB8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" width="4278" height="2634" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542382156909-9ae37b3